1
00:00:01,199 --> 00:00:04,352
What's the Weather? Weather with Mimo!

2
00:00:04,652 --> 00:00:09,642
Mimo: Hi friends! Let's look outside. What's the weather like today?

3
00:00:09,942 --> 00:00:13,331
Pip: Let's be weather reporters! Every day the weather can be different!

4
00:00:13,631 --> 00:00:17,404
Mimo: Today it's sunny! The sun is bright and warm.

5
00:00:17,704 --> 00:00:19,220
Mimo: Can you say sunny?

6
00:00:23,120 --> 00:00:26,316
Pip: Sunny days are for playing outside! And wearing a hat!

7
00:00:26,616 --> 00:00:31,678
Mimo: Uh oh. Now big clouds are covering the sun. It's cloudy!

8
00:00:31,978 --> 00:00:33,502
Mimo: Can you say cloudy?

9
00:00:36,837 --> 00:00:40,048
Lulu: When it's cloudy, it might start to rain soon.

10
00:00:40,348 --> 00:00:43,261
Mimo: Oh! Drip, drop! It's rainy!

11
00:00:43,561 --> 00:00:47,765
Mimo: When it's rainy, we use an umbrella and wear rain boots!

12
00:00:48,065 --> 00:00:49,590
Mimo: Can you say rainy?

13
00:00:52,115 --> 00:00:54,463
Bruno: Puddles! I love jumping in puddles!

14
00:00:57,158 --> 00:00:59,558
Mimo: Bruno! You splashed us!

15
00:00:59,858 --> 00:01:02,112
Bruno: Oops! Big bear, big splash!

16
00:01:02,412 --> 00:01:07,129
Mimo: Whoosh! Now it's windy! The wind is blowing everything around!

17
00:01:07,429 --> 00:01:08,947
Mimo: Can you say windy?

18
00:01:10,647 --> 00:01:13,501
Pip: Wheee! The wind is taking my kite up high!

19
00:01:15,801 --> 00:01:18,401
Pip: Whoa! The wind is taking ME up high!

20
00:01:24,401 --> 00:01:26,865
Pip: Wheee! The wind is very strong today!

21
00:01:29,365 --> 00:01:33,712
Mimo: Look! It's snowy! Little white snowflakes are falling!

22
00:01:34,012 --> 00:01:35,698
Mimo: Can you say snowy?

23
00:01:39,198 --> 00:01:43,705
Bruno: Brrr! When it's snowy, we wear warm coats, hats and mittens!

24
00:01:44,005 --> 00:01:45,448
Lulu: And build snowmen!

25
00:01:45,748 --> 00:01:50,375
Mimo: And sometimes, after the rain and the sun, we see a rainbow!

26
00:01:50,675 --> 00:01:52,729
Pip: Rainbows are my favorite weather!

27
00:01:53,029 --> 00:01:56,091
Mimo: Let's say all the weather together! Ready?

28
00:01:56,391 --> 00:01:57,174
Pip: Sunny!

29
00:01:58,074 --> 00:01:58,889
Lulu: Cloudy!

30
00:01:59,789 --> 00:02:00,325
Bruno: Rainy!

31
00:02:01,225 --> 00:02:02,017
Pip: Windy!

32
00:02:02,917 --> 00:02:03,939
Mimo: Snowy!

33
00:02:04,239 --> 00:02:06,715
Mimo: Great job, weather reporters!

34
00:02:08,315 --> 00:02:10,756
Bruno: What's the weather in my tummy? I think it's... rumbly!

35
00:02:13,056 --> 00:02:17,796
Mimo: Bye bye, friends! See you next time on Mimo Bunny TV!
